[1035]={["atomIDs"]={"1035:description:1-54","1035:description:57-129","1035:description:132-179","1035:description:184-250","1035:description:252-280","1035:description:285-375","1035:description:378-428","1035:description:433-478","1035:objective:1-97"},["opening"]="Relara's fever had passed, but Pelturas feared rest alone could not restore her strength. The moonstones once gathered at Fallen Sky Lake were now hoarded by a Shadethicket Oracle, making one of them the next hope for her recovery.",["pending"]="{actor} would obtain a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle for Pelturas.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Oracle's Fallen Moonstone to Pelturas Whitemoon.",["sourceHash"]="7eaa00de9e7c479a1d5f40838426695ea1973ce1ef2a53bc3bfc2fb241110b53",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1036]={["atomIDs"]={"1036:description:7-30","1036:description:33-114","1036:description:117-221","1036:description:226-310","1036:description:313-402","1036:objective:1-93"},["opening"]="Duncan saw an enemy of Booty Bay as a possible Bloodsail recruit. Firallon sought help for a special mission below decks aboard his flagship off Stranglethorn's coast.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to speak with Fleet Master Firallon aboard his ship.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Fleet Master Firallon aboard his flagship.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="350752ec2257563a6255f60e72d4d76be36f8aa2467e58ec57ebef127632eb6d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1037]={["atomIDs"]={"1037:description:1-61","1037:description:63-171","1037:description:173-204","1037:description:209-245","1037:description:247-298","1037:description:300-438","1037:description:443-500","1037:objective:1-70"},["opening"]="Melyria knew little of Velinde Starsong, her predecessor who vanished after her efforts against Felwood faltered. A Sentinel commander in Darnassus might know more than the successor left to continue that work.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to ask Thyn'tel Bladeweaver about Velinde's disappearance.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Thyn'tel Bladeweaver in Darnassus.",["sourceHash"]="8a2b7b425fcbaf37a149d166158bae0a8c952bcf77356c4d2447c87d9807966d",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1038]={["atomIDs"]={"1038:description:1-41","1038:description:43-121","1038:description:123-219","1038:description:221-311","1038:description:316-443","1038:description:445-502","1038:objective:1-119"},["opening"]="Thyn'tel permitted a search of Velinde's stored belongings. The Sentinels still trusted the absent priestess and thought she might return, but her duty journal might help explain why she left.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Velinde's journal and return it with the chest key to Thyn'tel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Velinde's journal and the key to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver.",["sourceHash"]="17d1e5b45f1d06b1944c1a607131a3a6b29cb67a1adee68e28568f4c6a73dbf8",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1039]={["atomIDs"]={"1039:description:1-40","1039:description:42-137","1039:description:139-300","1039:description:305-390","1039:description:392-450","1039:description:452-488","1039:objective:1-43"},["opening"]="Thyn'tel suspected Velinde took a trading ship from Ratchet toward Blackwater Cove. The dockmaster's passenger records offered a way to test that supposition after a journey through Horde-patrolled country.",["pending"]="{actor} would consult Wharfmaster Dizzywig in Ratchet.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Wharfmaster Dizzywig about Velinde's passage.",["sourceHash"]="9453950ade5e0e5d1bb72cec7c4266a46fd4d239c08243bce5e9904270c84f88",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1040]={["atomIDs"]={"1040:description:1-25","1040:description:27-84","1040:description:86-95","1040:description:100-107","1040:description:109-156","1040:description:158-242","1040:description:247-415","1040:description:417-461","1040:description:466-481","1040:description:483-508","1040:objective:1-59"},["opening"]="Dizzywig found Velinde booked aboard the Black Osprey to Booty Bay. He had no record of trouble and recalled advising her about Ruzzgot's overland caravan, leaving another possible witness across the sea.",["pending"]="{actor} would travel to Booty Bay and speak with Caravaneer Ruzzgot.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Caravaneer Ruzzgot in Booty Bay for the next inquiry.",["sourceHash"]="66d6a7cbcd96a011e9cc0ae788aef582de3efc482cdf8fe37abb5950cc1b113b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1041]={["atomIDs"]={"1041:description:1-80","1041:description:85-151","1041:description:153-290","1041:description:295-353","1041:description:355-397","1041:description:399-426","1041:description:431-503","1041:objective:1-37"},["opening"]="Ruzzgot remembered the unusual night elf passenger who joined his caravan. Velinde left him on the northward road for Darkshire, where the clerk's records might continue her trail.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to ask Clerk Daltry in Darkshire about Velinde.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the inquiry to Clerk Daltry in Darkshire.",["sourceHash"]="c41f436fb1f317d3596d95d1e65f87acc12f4e8ef63957f81a0c45574e0037d0",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1042]={["atomIDs"]={"1042:description:1-74","1042:description:76-203","1042:description:208-278","1042:description:280-349","1042:description:351-383","1042:description:385-435","1042:description:437-488","1042:objective:1-41"},["opening"]="Daltry had no record of Velinde staying in Darkshire, but recognized the reports of wolf-men. Calor's work led him to recommend Jonathan Carevin, whose family hunted such creatures.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Jonathan Carevin about the wolf-men.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} consulted Jonathan Carevin in Darkshire.",["sourceHash"]="e7f186dcb8514eb9bf11381bdcf3d0eee31e8072432117cc7c998229d6386a29",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1043]={["atomIDs"]={"1043:description:1-24","1043:description:26-202","1043:description:207-271","1043:description:273-361","1043:description:366-463","1043:description:465-511","1043:objective:1-83"},["opening"]="Carevin cared more for reducing worgen than understanding the stranger's motives. He directed the search toward the southern mine where the creatures were first reported and asked for any significant findings to return.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to search for signs of the Scythe of Elune and report to Carevin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the search for signs of the Scythe of Elune and returned to Jonathan Carevin.",["sourceHash"]="754cdaf2e426eadfc20ae6e47840d28ac79dbf94072b38f332d33ca1311ff769",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1044]={["aftermath"]="Thyn'tel accepted the account of Velinde's fate and feared the High Priestess's disappointment. To her, the Scythe's loss from Elune's servants remained an unsettled danger.",["atomIDs"]={"1044:description:1-59","1044:description:61-173","1044:description:175-253","1044:description:258-283","1044:description:285-381","1044:objective:1-44"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1044:completion:1-38","1044:completion:40-144","1044:completion:146-297","1044:completion:302-342","1044:completion:344-413"},["opening"]="Carevin believed the mine's discoveries explained an evil brought into Duskwood, and said he bore the absent priestess no ill will. Others still needed the findings, so the long inquiry turned back toward Thyn'tel in Darnassus.",["pending"]="{actor} would report back to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver in Darnassus.",["sourceHash"]="896780139289ceb128692f3dbd445a3f09add2165e7ace280d19d3d0223bc5c6",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1045]={["atomIDs"]={"1045:description:1-82","1045:description:84-117","1045:description:119-157","1045:description:162-234","1045:description:236-292","1045:description:297-328","1045:description:330-353","1045:description:355-396","1045:description:398-497","1045:objective:1-82"},["opening"]="Krolg blamed night elf arrogance but insisted his own people remained responsible for their actions. He named Ran Bloodtooth as an evil strengthened by corruption and called for the leader and four guards to be stopped.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront Ran Bloodtooth and four Bloodtooth Guards for Krolg.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the assignment against Ran Bloodtooth and four Bloodtooth Guards and returned to Krolg.",["sourceHash"]="9de7025283bc4846e90bdc9c1370417d57222ac77dd3293285ddb19d185c48ea",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1046]={["aftermath"]="Raene intended to place the skull and Dartol's Rod where others could see them with reverence. Her thanks recalled Teronis, whose unfinished search had begun the undertaking.",["atomIDs"]={"1046:description:1-64","1046:description:69-115","1046:objective:1-97"},["bridge"]="The Bloodtooth assignment had returned to Krolg. He sent the trophy onward to Raene, with Dartol's Rod accompanying the skull as the undertaking returned to Astranaar.",["bridgeFrom"]=1045,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"1046:completion:1-66","1046:completion:71-117","1046:completion:119-156","1046:completion:158-222","1046:completion:227-308","1046:completion:313-335","1046:completion:337-352"},["opening"]="Krolg sent a trophy back to the traveler's own people. Ran Bloodtooth's skull and Dartol's Rod had to return together to Raene in Astranaar as evidence of the undertaking.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Ran Bloodtooth's Skull and Dartol's Rod to Raene.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Ran Bloodtooth's Skull and Dartol's Rod of Transformation to Raene.",["sourceHash"]="d4bc6d32f22a376f8d91bda120994bc3e1dec283650248739de8c9d544f3470d",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1047]={["atomIDs"]={"1047:description:1-18","1047:description:23-135","1047:description:138-303","1047:description:308-380","1047:description:383-461","1047:objective:1-146"},["opening"]="Moonstalker announced the need for honorable volunteers in the lands west of Tanaris. The Cenarion Circle's public call led to its Arch Druid in Darnassus for further information.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to discuss the new frontier with Fandral.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm about the announced exploration.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="67fe573f95025818a079bc07aef6ae0038a9a7aa0d9aa793b2bbaa8923e8b37e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1049]={["atomIDs"]={"1049:description:1-66","1049:description:68-155","1049:description:160-232","1049:description:234-256","1049:description:258-329","1049:description:334-434","1049:description:436-510","1049:objective:1-124"},["opening"]="Truthseeker questioned the haste of the pact with the Forsaken while acknowledging the Earthen Ring's intentions. Research guarded by Scarlet zealots might help him judge the plagued allies more carefully.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the Compendium of the Fallen for Truthseeker.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Compendium of the Fallen to Sage Truthseeker.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="16e205117ab6bfc68b53a92f042c79b806476a2d759673af2adda327858023e6",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="162",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1050]={["atomIDs"]={"1050:description:1-25","1050:description:27-95","1050:description:100-200","1050:description:205-314","1050:description:316-419","1050:description:424-497","1050:objective:1-104"},["opening"]="Mae believed study of the past might better prepare the living for an inevitable future. A rumored Titan text in the old Monastery library offered one piece of that lost northern knowledge.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover Mythology of the Titans for Mae.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Mythology of the Titans to Librarian Mae Paledust.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="d3f78f7ef80dc178781cfc97c641c8fe30e2ecfcddb7442957728ae281e24d1f",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1051]={["atomIDs"]={"1051:description:1-63","1051:description:65-109","1051:description:111-137","1051:description:142-176","1051:description:178-199","1051:description:201-245","1051:description:247-258","1051:description:263-272","1051:description:274-288","1051:description:293-380","1051:description:382-473","1051:description:478-500","1051:objective:1-70"},["opening"]="Weeks of torture had left Vorrel believing his remaining existence nearly over. He said Vishas gave his wedding ring to Nancy at Lordamere and asked that it be recovered for his own wife in Tarren Mill.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return Vorrel's wedding ring to Monika.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Vorrel Sengutz's wedding ring to Monika Sengutz.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="aaaea25f5d1a6fcc8a71086f84e109cd81d62ddbcfdff82b8afa7ffbc4e03676",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1053]={["atomIDs"]={"1053:description:1-64","1053:description:66-136","1053:description:141-248","1053:description:250-327","1053:description:329-402","1053:description:408-468","1053:description:470-511","1053:objective:1-169"},["opening"]="Raleigh had once honored the Scarlet cause against the undead. He left after seeing innocent people tortured as supposedly plagued merely for lacking the Crusade tabard, and now called for its leaders removed in the Light's name.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront Whitemane, Mograine, Herod and Loksey for Raleigh.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment against the four named Scarlet leaders and reported to Raleigh.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="993e1204bfe5f91c4e937c1cc9d97326687b9712fd6dc81c8777a86b6fc3453f",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1054]={["atomIDs"]={"1054:description:1-62","1054:description:64-143","1054:description:145-223","1054:description:228-351","1054:description:353-360","1054:description:365-421","1054:description:423-440","1054:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Scouts reported rapid Thistlefur growth north of Astranaar. Raene feared their numbers might embolden an attack on the town and asked for Dal Bloodclaw's skull as evidence of pressure on the tribe.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Dal Bloodclaw's Skull to Raene.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Dal Bloodclaw's Skull to Raene Wolfrunner.",["sourceHash"]="cadcceae45ca27f3988b36ac24b752d807f68c0fe396905ebb83a767aa243d7d",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1055]={["atomIDs"]={"1055:description:1-42","1055:description:44-88","1055:objective:1-37"},["opening"]="The rod lay complete after the shrine's work. Shael'dryn waited at the moonwell for word that the enchantment had succeeded.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return to Shael'dryn at the moonwell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Shael'dryn with news of the rod.",["sourceHash"]="bf582f6adfbfc7811f8e778dc536cbb40d1f7d5aae582ce165e349e50dba8a99",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1056]={["atomIDs"]={"1056:description:1-63","1056:description:68-153","1056:description:155-251","1056:description:253-375","1056:description:380-408","1056:description:410-430","1056:description:435-463","1056:objective:1-45"},["opening"]="Faldreas directed a traveler through Talondeep Path into Stonetalon. Beyond Windshear Crag and Cragpool Lake, the climb to Stonetalon Peak led to Keeper Albagorm and the work awaiting there.",["pending"]="{actor} would travel to Keeper Albagorm on Stonetalon Peak.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Keeper Albagorm on Stonetalon Peak.",["sourceHash"]="cc407b6f78f514198a917636f7feb866c5f3064580f276afb3dca7989ee0f798",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1057]={["aftermath"]="Albagorm hoped the work of restoring the land could begin; regrowth itself remained ahead.",["atomIDs"]={"1057:description:1-80","1057:description:85-145","1057:description:147-208","1057:description:210-264","1057:description:269-360","1057:description:362-460","1057:description:465-499","1057:objective:1-147"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1057:completion:1-115"},["opening"]="Fire had already devastated the Charred Vale. Albagorm said Bloodfury occupation prevented passage into the land where restoration had to begin.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to drive back the four Bloodfury groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Albagorm's assignment against the harpies.",["sourceHash"]="5a0f2b26705a03f82bc6bb3de0a8e5c4012a6754dec8f46b2beb587743ab8635",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1058]={["atomIDs"]={"1058:description:1-16","1058:description:21-62","1058:description:64-121","1058:description:123-156","1058:description:158-180","1058:description:182-194","1058:description:199-238","1058:description:240-298","1058:description:300-378","1058:description:380-438","1058:description:443-504","1058:objective:1-131"},["opening"]="Jin'Zil had three elven captives and a proposed forest concoction for them. Sap, whiskers, eyes and a fey dragon scale formed his shopping list.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather Jin'Zil's four kinds of ingredients.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the requested ingredients to Jin'Zil.",["sourceHash"]="00208a292c981783160c8c0638f7c134da98bbc3cc3443d91b8ba2bcf5c69b59",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1059]={["aftermath"]="Falfindel undertook to seek aid from the great forest for the Charred Vale.",["atomIDs"]={"1059:description:1-34","1059:description:36-92","1059:description:97-159","1059:description:161-298","1059:description:303-430","1059:description:435-456","1059:description:458-478","1059:objective:1-76"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1059:completion:1-55","1059:completion:60-172"},["opening"]="Albagorm expected the subdued harpies to regroup. He sought Falfindel's ability to call forest spirits before the opportunity to reclaim the vale closed.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to seek Falfindel near Feralas.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Albagorm's appeal to Falfindel.",["sourceHash"]="6ae7ef206544461590f51844fc2206ad4ac6e7402f4681389e81730905b3cf5d",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1060]={["aftermath"]="Jin'Zil recalled Rokhan's earlier part in the elder Bloodfeather's death.",["atomIDs"]={"1060:description:1-31","1060:description:33-109","1060:description:114-157","1060:description:159-229","1060:description:231-388","1060:description:393-505","1060:objective:1-80"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1060:completion:1-26","1060:completion:28-67","1060:completion:72-117","1060:completion:119-231","1060:completion:233-264"},["opening"]="Darsok sent news of Serena's death to an old friend in Stonetalon. His letter followed the harpies' origins beyond the Barrens.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry Darsok's letter to Jin'Zil.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the letter at Malaka'jin.",["sourceHash"]="4fb608662e29848deec14a3c2ddf4ab856cb1b6aeb424f14a11a4f06335d46ef",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1061]={["atomIDs"]={"1061:description:1-120","1061:description:123-188","1061:description:190-200","1061:description:205-280","1061:description:283-362","1061:description:367-393","1061:description:396-457","1061:description:460-497","1061:objective:1-58"},["opening"]="Reports of deforestation had reached Zor through Seereth. He described Stonetalon's spirits crying out as goblins and their servants burned the land.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to join Seereth near Greatwood Vale.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Seereth in Stonetalon.",["sourceHash"]="28f0a56ae391b67f332b7f399cb81c568a30d4184780bef52cb365840cebdcdf",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1062]={["aftermath"]="Seereth regarded this as a first step and still saw a need for tauren elders to calm the spirits.",["atomIDs"]={"1062:description:1-125","1062:description:128-189","1062:description:192-224","1062:description:229-298","1062:description:301-420","1062:description:423-471","1062:description:476-484","1062:objective:1-19","1062:objective:21-107"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1062:completion:1-17","1062:completion:22-113","1062:completion:118-196"},["opening"]="Seereth saw the Venture Company's logging as the cause of the spirits' pain. Windshear Crag's workforce was her first target for stopping the destruction.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront fifteen company loggers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Seereth's assignment against the loggers.",["sourceHash"]="1faa271a72cbef5ee863e99435762437e2c3f3f6f127e48779978e05ca2f71cc",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1063]={["atomIDs"]={"1063:description:1-74","1063:description:79-152","1063:description:155-208","1063:description:211-273","1063:description:278-380","1063:description:383-452","1063:objective:1-36"},["bridge"]="Force could not by itself tend the wounded spirits. Seereth sought the knowledge of the elder Magatha in Thunder Bluff.",["bridgeFrom"]=1062,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Seereth knew that force alone could not tend Stonetalon's spirits. She turned to Magatha's age and knowledge for help in gathering spiritual aid.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to tell Magatha of Stonetalon's peril.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} sought Magatha's counsel on Elder Rise.",["sourceHash"]="023ba41cddf386dbef8ab90448763893369d753af92f4daca6ee88bb5ee92366",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1064]={["aftermath"]="Zamah expressed sorrow for the spirits and readiness to assist.",["atomIDs"]={"1064:description:1-85","1064:description:88-162","1064:description:167-230","1064:description:233-258","1064:description:261-353","1064:description:358-385","1064:description:388-436","1064:description:439-501","1064:objective:1-68"},["bridge"]="Magatha proposed Forsaken knowledge of disease as a possible aid. The appeal to the emissary also offered a chance to strengthen trust between allied peoples.",["bridgeFrom"]=1063,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"1064:completion:1-37","1064:completion:39-123","1064:completion:128-176"},["opening"]="Magatha proposed Forsaken knowledge of disease as aid for Stonetalon's spirits. Help from their emissary might also strengthen trust between the allied peoples.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to consult Zamah below Spirit Rise.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met the apothecary.",["sourceHash"]="8911865c385b1511b9287748f46c036ea2fdfb4da70f5e0b6b566761b008a99f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1065]={["aftermath"]="Lydon read it and said he knew the tool to make.",["atomIDs"]={"1065:description:1-72","1065:description:75-105","1065:description:110-160","1065:description:163-279","1065:description:284-352","1065:description:355-436","1065:description:441-475","1065:description:478-505","1065:objective:1-54"},["bridge"]="Zamah's proposed measure required help from Tarren Mill. Her note would explain to Lydon why a toxin was being sought for the company.",["bridgeFrom"]=1064,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"1065:completion:1-18","1065:completion:20-68","1065:completion:70-96","1065:completion:101-113","1065:completion:115-140"},["opening"]="Zamah sought an extreme measure that she described as avoiding bloodshed. Her colleague in distant Tarren Mill might supply the toxin, with her note explaining the need.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Zamah's request to Lydon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the note.",["sourceHash"]="57879fa371d4576ba896c2fae657295e44b014f7b44ae0dcea7e8a877e775e9d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1066]={["aftermath"]="Lydon prepared to mix the concoction from the recovered material.",["atomIDs"]={"1066:description:1-101","1066:description:104-158","1066:description:163-256","1066:description:261-349","1066:description:351-422","1066:description:427-501","1066:objective:1-67"},["bridge"]="Lydon described a concoction meant to leave the workforce weak and docile. Blood already collected by Syndicate shadow mages was the difficult ingredient he required.",["bridgeFrom"]=1065,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"1066:completion:1-10","1066:completion:13-58","1066:completion:63-132","1066:completion:135-204","1066:completion:209-257"},["opening"]="Lydon proposed a toxin that would leave the company weak and docile. Innocent blood was the difficult ingredient, already collected by Syndicate shadow mages for purposes of their own.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover five vials from Durnholde.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Lydon with the blood.",["sourceHash"]="14add2df218ac80173c44f81659df9f6fd50a0b2dc6ea8b16df926ddce58d5f2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1067]={["atomIDs"]={"1067:description:1-18","1067:description:21-124","1067:description:127-195","1067:description:200-248","1067:description:251-321","1067:objective:1-57"},["bridge"]="With the toxin prepared, the problem became delivery. It had to return to Zamah before any attempt to put it into the company's supply route.",["bridgeFrom"]=1066,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="The toxin was prepared but needed a delivery method. Lydon sent it back to Zamah before field use, hoping its effects against the company might spread.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the toxin to Thunder Bluff.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it to Zamah.",["sourceHash"]="024911661ec480e99d3aa743d68cc9f7dec583aaaa54415e5ac8c1ab0826b324",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1068]={["aftermath"]="Seereth reported that many spirits were soothed, while the company's departure remained only a hope.",["atomIDs"]={"1068:description:1-85","1068:description:88-156","1068:description:159-240","1068:description:245-370","1068:description:373-407","1068:description:412-471","1068:description:476-489","1068:objective:1-126"},["bridge"]="Two machines stood clearly in Seereth's visions of falling trees: XT:4 and XT:9. They offered a separate target within the same damage to the crag.",["bridgeFrom"]=1062,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"1068:completion:1-97","1068:completion:99-187","1068:completion:192-291"},["opening"]="Among indistinct spirit voices, Seereth had seen two clear shapes: machines felling trees at impossible speed. Their markings identified XT:4 and XT:9 in Windshear Crag.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to stop both shredders from Seereth's vision.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment against XT:4 and XT:9.",["sourceHash"]="e652912abc4fe0789ca90ee06e64fcafb8995e0fb68f8e63e9216b3dbf489432",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1069]={["aftermath"]="Mebok planned to send the eggs through Dizzywig for shipment to Booty Bay.",["atomIDs"]={"1069:description:1-48","1069:description:51-67","1069:description:69-92","1069:description:97-119","1069:description:124-232","1069:description:235-274","1069:description:279-348","1069:description:353-371","1069:description:373-469","1069:objective:1-52"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1069:completion:1-13","1069:completion:15-24","1069:completion:29-95","1069:completion:97-128","1069:completion:133-153","1069:completion:155-197"},["opening"]="A fashion for spider-egg omelettes had created a shortage in Booty Bay. Mebok saw profit in Stonetalon's deepmoss nests.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather fifteen deepmoss eggs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the eggs to Mebok.",["sourceHash"]="9d341367f81e3e4fcb487aefe25c92b11b40c6c051ea6d31298cb8a71437c258",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1070]={["atomIDs"]={"1070:description:1-10","1070:description:15-68","1070:description:70-111","1070:description:113-151","1070:description:153-189","1070:description:194-349","1070:description:351-430","1070:description:432-458","1070:description:463-503","1070:objective:1-98"},["opening"]="Thenysil had heard nothing from Kaela since she went to investigate Stonetalon's damaged lands. An accompanying gnome mage increased the sentinel's concern, and she asked that Kaela be found above Windshear Crag's entrance.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Kaela Shadowspear in Stonetalon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Kaela Shadowspear overlooking the valley into Windshear Crag.",["sourceHash"]="4788cca92e7f43d87fac6eb27b53e4ab44cc36b6b6189272567b69768a5a8cf7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1071]={["aftermath"]="Gaxim proposed using explosives for a new plan, but reported that his supplies had run low.",["atomIDs"]={"1071:description:1-122","1071:description:124-136","1071:description:138-237","1071:description:242-317","1071:description:319-372","1071:description:377-414","1071:description:416-507","1071:objective:1-19","1071:objective:21-47","1071:objective:49-105"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1071:completion:1-33","1071:completion:35-68","1071:completion:73-106","1071:completion:108-118","1071:completion:120-170","1071:completion:175-302","1071:completion:304-434"},["opening"]="Gaxim wanted to show that engineering and magic could help save the forest. Constant pressure from company loggers left him no time to finish his devices.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to hold back the loggers and deforesters.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Gaxim's assignment in Windshear Crag.",["sourceHash"]="d8b545412954d98dd374b43f94c7955e8a0e7b01976066270b691678faa78f6f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1072]={["atomIDs"]={"1072:description:1-66","1072:description:68-115","1072:description:117-203","1072:description:208-285","1072:description:290-365","1072:description:367-394","1072:description:399-482","1072:objective:1-38"},["opening"]="Gaxim's latest device required a potent substance only his old colleague made. Lomac in Ironforge was the source of the needed NG-5.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to consult Lomac in Tinker Town.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Lomac with Gaxim's request.",["sourceHash"]="2433d9b32e5fec36e73d137425191da6b5c4c1f9a7c1812f3902fdee37db0396",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1073]={["atomIDs"]={"1073:description:1-9","1073:description:11-81","1073:description:86-125","1073:description:127-205","1073:description:210-247","1073:description:252-350","1073:description:355-478","1073:objective:1-92"},["opening"]="Lomac was willing to make the volatile compound, but had none on hand. He demanded mana potions and fortitude elixirs before preparing another batch.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to supply Lomac's potion requirements.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the potions and elixirs to Lomac.",["sourceHash"]="3030acc2ad45ce24c4c5ba6da2f0d7b6064417e558dc72ef5b913d264ec44c0b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1074]={["aftermath"]="Gaxim identified it as the component for igniting wagons of dynamite in a planned distraction.",["atomIDs"]={"1074:description:1-22","1074:description:24-50","1074:description:52-71","1074:description:76-139","1074:description:141-188","1074:objective:1-69"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1074:completion:1-39","1074:completion:44-124","1074:completion:129-133","1074:completion:135-150","1074:completion:152-164","1074:completion:166-208","1074:completion:210-227"},["opening"]="Lomac handed over the volatile preparation with a warning. The compound had to return to Gaxim before the Stonetalon plan could advance.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry the NG-5 back to Gaxim.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the compound to Gaxim.",["sourceHash"]="906ef585316dfab650e493552a0c283abd7add5a5401df658c22cd418b22e382",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1075]={["atomIDs"]={"1075:description:1-54","1075:description:56-96","1075:description:101-218","1075:description:220-335","1075:description:340-412","1075:description:414-456","1075:description:458-501","1075:objective:1-32"},["opening"]="Gaxim's device needed a spell that would trigger explosives at a distance. His friend Collin in Stormwind might supply that missing element.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to seek Collin's help in Stormwind.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Collin in the Mage Quarter.",["sourceHash"]="33704f5cda3d742a533c4c960534055494acf623ae4d07af69173b30975c233c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1076]={["atomIDs"]={"1076:description:1-22","1076:description:24-43","1076:description:45-89","1076:description:94-155","1076:description:157-202","1076:description:207-315","1076:description:317-447","1076:description:452-480","1076:objective:1-54"},["opening"]="Collin proposed a messaging spell for Gaxim's remote trigger. Dust devil debris from Westfall was needed to impress that magic onto a scroll.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring dust devil debris to Collin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Collin with the debris.",["sourceHash"]="a6022f4621cffa6d188abcb9cf3b458a0faa13d16b5d3d86b5546745fe8614af",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1077]={["aftermath"]="Gaxim planned to combine the spell with NG-5 so a distraction could cover the theft of company documents.",["atomIDs"]={"1077:description:1-17","1077:description:19-40","1077:description:45-98","1077:description:100-174","1077:description:179-188","1077:objective:1-64"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1077:completion:1-20","1077:completion:22-31","1077:completion:36-108","1077:completion:113-246","1077:completion:251-302"},["opening"]="Collin's completed scroll carried the messaging magic back toward Stonetalon. Gaxim awaited it as the remaining part of his remote explosive.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the scroll to Gaxim.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the messaging scroll to Gaxim.",["sourceHash"]="204a71f9b9cbf8a94d3fa3903c951916ca51aec2e16d04e7f42c4eb0867e2f68",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1078]={["atomIDs"]={"1078:description:1-56","1078:description:58-200","1078:description:205-378","1078:description:383-456","1078:description:461-510","1078:objective:1-57"},["opening"]="Collin remembered basilisks in the Charred Vale whose powdered scales served his spells. He requested samples if the creatures still survived there.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to collect eight crystallized scales.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the basilisk scales to Collin.",["sourceHash"]="ad850e748035d31696f1c7192a412f6dddf531d0f7dd84abc7e26113f0cb2d5b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1079]={["aftermath"]="Gaxim expected the designs to reveal machine weaknesses and useful techniques for his own work.",["atomIDs"]={"1079:description:1-15","1079:description:17-36","1079:description:38-80","1079:description:85-192","1079:description:197-283","1079:description:285-421","1079:objective:1-84"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1079:completion:1-14","1079:completion:16-53","1079:completion:58-166","1079:completion:168-199"},["opening"]="Gaxim's prepared devices offered a distraction, but the operation's purpose was information. Engineering plans inside the lumber mill mattered more than the destruction outside.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the company's engineering plans.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the plans to Gaxim.",["sourceHash"]="28b68cc7c7f7e6e1f4dc0343b2fd615f14cca0552ee3fed62f5278733f9f4d22",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1080]={["atomIDs"]={"1080:description:1-37","1080:description:42-102","1080:description:107-140","1080:description:142-155","1080:description:160-232","1080:description:234-284","1080:objective:1-24","1080:objective:26-87"},["opening"]="The second operation turned toward Windshear Mine and its letters. Gaxim stressed recovery of the papers while the explosives diverted attention.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the letters from Windshear Mine.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the company letters to Gaxim.",["sourceHash"]="2d88da1da98e96abb5287593fa4da489a0e6b920e39b04f9b0311a1f868c99f8",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1081]={["atomIDs"]={"1081:description:1-98","1081:description:103-236","1081:description:241-354","1081:objective:1-38"},["opening"]="Thenysil saw the Stonetalon work as a possible foundation for a stronger position. She directed its participant to Tyrande at the Temple of the Moon.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to meet Tyrande in Darnassus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} received Tyrande's acknowledgment in Darnassus.",["sourceHash"]="85627b71d2a1d717ac9d609a363a72aa2787ca07e1aba4b8948d7da04586be46",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1082]={["aftermath"]="Thenysil expressed relief that both Kaela and Gaxim were doing well.",["atomIDs"]={"1082:description:1-54","1082:description:59-154","1082:description:156-215","1082:description:217-238","1082:description:243-333","1082:objective:1-41"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1082:completion:1-14","1082:completion:16-56","1082:completion:61-84","1082:completion:86-116","1082:completion:121-151"},["opening"]="Kaela sent reassurance to the Sentinels that she and Gaxim remained alive. She hoped their efforts against the company would also help heal the land.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to report Kaela's news to Thenysil.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the update in Astranaar.",["sourceHash"]="a0338546db596564460c1a100a30e9be47dcda7a4e9b1932b41fba29b5b17c17",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1083]={["atomIDs"]={"1083:description:1-31","1083:description:33-111","1083:description:116-228","1083:description:233-343","1083:description:348-423","1083:description:428-497","1083:objective:1-113"},["opening"]="Kaela knew the company burned the vale but remained unsure exactly what it unleashed. Burning elementals now obstructed the land's recovery.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather eight smoldering embers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the embers to Kaela.",["sourceHash"]="79392771c72f289ce769297a5f1f7c802ee6d90876449aa9a9fcf80d148f1589",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1084]={["aftermath"]="Kaela planned to pass the sample to Gaxim for examination; the proposed cause remained under study.",["atomIDs"]={"1084:description:1-109","1084:description:111-128","1084:description:130-200","1084:description:205-305","1084:description:310-427","1084:description:432-493","1084:objective:1-70"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1084:completion:1-14","1084:completion:19-109","1084:completion:111-146"},["opening"]="The vale's treants were corrupted as well as wounded. Gaxim suspected weapons used in the company's retreat, and Kaela sought shrapnel to test that theory.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover a piece of corroded shrapnel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the shrapnel sample to Kaela.",["sourceHash"]="dee7cc266cbd201ba3a72cac298d378f3d35a37d455588786684d9225e22c74c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1085]={["atomIDs"]={"1085:description:1-101","1085:description:106-120","1085:description:122-213","1085:description:218-297","1085:description:302-356","1085:description:361-420","1085:description:422-434","1085:objective:1-15"},["opening"]="Kaela described devastation by the Venture Company and urged that her gnome ally be judged by his work. Gaxim understood their need to cooperate and was the next person to consult about helping.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Gaxim Rustfizzle.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Gaxim Rustfizzle.",["sourceHash"]="4e7d6339f4b1d5fed98736c913e72a92c737f803526e389c3c98f7c36789746e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1086]={["aftermath"]="Zamah welcomed the port's discovery and hoped the toxin would reach headquarters, without claiming it already had.",["atomIDs"]={"1086:description:1-19","1086:description:22-54","1086:description:57-89","1086:description:94-225","1086:description:228-324","1086:description:327-440","1086:description:443-485","1086:description:490-507","1086:objective:1-41","1086:objective:43-84"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1086:completion:1-19","1086:completion:21-34","1086:completion:36-97","1086:completion:99-157","1086:completion:162-283","1086:completion:285-316","1086:completion:321-403","1086:completion:408-436","1086:completion:438-468"},["opening"]="Zamah expected a small company sky port to move messages and cargo. Finding it and placing the prepared fogger would test both the logistical inference and the toxin's route toward the company beyond Stonetalon.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find the sky port and deploy the fogger.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the delivery and returned.",["sourceHash"]="3a3cf2baefeca86bd4e748e043f0529bd1b42b21c499632784781e519f720c3a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1087]={["aftermath"]="Braelyn reported a renewed flow of power, speaking from her own appetite for magic.",["atomIDs"]={"1087:description:1-63","1087:description:65-225","1087:description:227-248","1087:description:253-386","1087:description:391-463","1087:description:465-509","1087:objective:1-117"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1087:completion:1-24","1087:completion:26-31","1087:completion:33-49","1087:completion:51-68","1087:completion:70-199","1087:completion:204-259"},["opening"]="Braelyn resented the druids' restraint of magical power and wanted to return to Jaedenar. Her assignment attacked Cenarius's followers around Stonetalon Peak.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry out Braelyn's attack on the peak.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Braelyn's assignment against the forest's defenders.",["sourceHash"]="84847d6d24083b9acddd807f684fa6bbf2082b563f8487584d2efefa2bbb796c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1088]={["atomIDs"]={"1088:description:1-52","1088:description:54-72","1088:description:74-141","1088:description:146-172","1088:description:174-179","1088:description:181-192","1088:description:194-208","1088:description:210-256","1088:description:258-266","1088:description:268-277","1088:description:279-319","1088:description:321-406","1088:description:411-465","1088:objective:1-62"},["bridge"]="Braelyn's attention moved from Stonetalon Peak to Raynewood. She claimed a magical sight of Ordanus high in a great tree and offered a gift for the head she wanted brought back.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"1088:description:1-52","1088:description:54-72","1088:description:74-141","1088:description:146-172","1088:description:174-179","1088:description:181-192","1088:description:194-208","1088:description:210-256","1088:description:258-266","1088:description:268-277","1088:description:279-319","1088:description:321-406","1088:description:411-465","1088:objective:1-62"},["bridgeFrom"]=1087,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="ea384b164f4650991b56fc6577692812f80b5c92bf53b48eaa540a78d4ba97f3",["opening"]="Braelyn claimed magical sight had revealed Ordanus atop a great tree at Raynewood. She sought his head after his removal from Stonetalon Peak.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find Ordanus and bring his head to Braelyn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Ordanus's head to Braelyn.",["sourceHash"]="ea384b164f4650991b56fc6577692812f80b5c92bf53b48eaa540a78d4ba97f3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1089]={["aftermath"]="Items appeared in the glowing opening when the three keys were fitted into place.",["atomIDs"]={"1089:description:1-87","1089:description:92-168","1089:description:173-196","1089:description:198-235","1089:description:240-384","1089:description:386-485","1089:objective:1-37","1089:objective:39-98","1089:objective:100-143"},["bridge"]="Braelyn's directions led back to the Talon Den on the peak. A key hidden in a lantern at the entrance would open the caches; their contents would unlock the hoard in a central part of the den.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"1089:description:1-87","1089:description:92-168","1089:description:173-196","1089:description:198-235","1089:description:240-384","1089:description:386-485","1089:objective:1-37","1089:objective:39-98","1089:objective:100-143"},["bridgeFrom"]=1088,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="782a9709f8954ba30eb220c7849138c96a2484a53cd69defc0f42766f08bd007",["endingAtomIDs"]={"1089:completion:1-117"},["independentReviewRevision"]="r2-findings-applied-2026-10-26",["opening"]="Braelyn described the Talon Den's layered safeguards. A lantern hid the first key; items in opened caches could then unlock the central hoard.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to open the caches and the Talon Den hoard.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} opened the hoard with the gathered keys.",["sourceHash"]="782a9709f8954ba30eb220c7849138c96a2484a53cd69defc0f42766f08bd007",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1090]={["aftermath"]="Piznik believed the disturbance had drawn attention and urged sending the ore to Ziz quickly.",["atomIDs"]={"1090:description:1-72","1090:description:74-113","1090:description:115-180","1090:description:182-237","1090:description:239-312","1090:description:317-417","1090:description:419-510","1090:objective:1-63"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1090:completion:1-11","1090:completion:13-122","1090:completion:127-233"},["opening"]="Piznik remained in the mines to gather information after Gerenzo displaced his former boss. He could extract a strange ore sample if protected from patrols.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to protect Piznik while he mines the sample.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} obtained Piznik's ore sample.",["sourceHash"]="067b19b7a37599a174f9bef8b0fdcd69a60754cd66dbb77f12febfca6c736d68",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1091]={["atomIDs"]={"1091:description:1-32","1091:description:34-73","1091:description:75-105","1091:description:110-218","1091:objective:1-21","1091:objective:23-51"},["opening"]="Gaxim sent the recovered company letters to Kaela. He wanted their success, and the role of his magic, made known to the Sentinels.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the letters to Kaela.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the letters to Kaela.",["sourceHash"]="1d762729d55faf0e77c7e0566f7322b49bea85f9a2f723c2f47c58bc2eabfca9",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1092]={["aftermath"]="Ziz anticipated interest from Undermine's engineers and intended to retain a piece for himself.",["atomIDs"]={"1092:description:1-57","1092:description:59-200","1092:description:205-237","1092:description:239-284","1092:description:289-383","1092:description:385-465","1092:description:467-476","1092:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1092:completion:1-73","1092:completion:75-152","1092:completion:157-257"},["opening"]="Piznik planned his own escape before the company learned what happened. The sample had to travel separately to Ziz on Windshear Crag's western side.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the unidentified ore to Ziz.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the ore sample to Ziz.",["sourceHash"]="8a86ee30db770127b6c7abf3fd2abb451886b585aa470da50cfb844a39e54080",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1093]={["atomIDs"]={"1093:description:1-52","1093:description:54-77","1093:description:79-108","1093:description:113-171","1093:description:173-212","1093:description:217-317","1093:description:319-381","1093:description:383-421","1093:description:423-480","1093:objective:1-81"},["bridge"]="Fizziks's new employment still drew him back toward the company that had dismissed him. Sputtervalve wanted the great woodcutter's plans, while Gerenzo's hostility kept Fizziks from retrieving them himself.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"1093:description:1-52","1093:description:54-77","1093:description:79-108","1093:description:113-171","1093:description:173-212","1093:description:217-317","1093:description:319-381","1093:description:383-421","1093:description:423-480","1093:objective:1-81"},["bridgeFrom"]=1483,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="eea6532f591d0368f44f2c08ef09aa907cd21b836f1902a15ee62cbf6afe4cbb",["opening"]="Sputtervalve hired Ziz after his dismissal from the company. Now Ziz wanted an operator's blueprints for the enormous woodcutting machine Gerenzo oversaw.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the machine's blueprints for Ziz.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Ziz with the Super Reaper blueprints.",["sourceHash"]="eea6532f591d0368f44f2c08ef09aa907cd21b836f1902a15ee62cbf6afe4cbb",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1094]={["aftermath"]="Sputtervalve distrusted Ziz but considered the information useful and acknowledged earlier benefits from company inventions.",["atomIDs"]={"1094:description:1-92","1094:description:94-162","1094:description:164-214","1094:description:219-280","1094:description:282-349","1094:objective:1-59"},["bridge"]="The blueprints joined the internal papers and manuals Fizziks had salvaged on his way out. Their sealed envelope would carry the Venture Company's technical knowledge back to Sputtervalve in Ratchet.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"1094:description:1-92","1094:description:94-162","1094:description:164-214","1094:description:219-280","1094:description:282-349","1094:objective:1-59"},["bridgeFrom"]=1093,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="9571c31a15494153ab6ab006c5cf9351db787f09c059ebb057348569f7f7f2c8",["endingAtomIDs"]={"1094:completion:1-12","1094:completion:14-75","1094:completion:77-140","1094:completion:145-193","1094:completion:195-280"},["opening"]="Ziz bundled the blueprints with manuals and internal papers salvaged during his dismissal. Sputtervalve in Ratchet was to receive the collection.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver Ziz's sealed envelope.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the envelope to Sputtervalve.",["sourceHash"]="9571c31a15494153ab6ab006c5cf9351db787f09c059ebb057348569f7f7f2c8",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1095]={["atomIDs"]={"1095:description:1-108","1095:description:110-184","1095:description:189-316","1095:description:318-361","1095:description:363-392","1095:description:397-504","1095:objective:1-64"},["bridge"]="Sputtervalve's reply turned the engineering dispute into an order against Gerenzo. Riddlevox had asked him to deal with the problem; the trade princes' hand behind that request remained his suspicion.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"1095:description:1-108","1095:description:110-184","1095:description:189-316","1095:description:318-361","1095:description:363-392","1095:description:397-504","1095:objective:1-64"},["bridgeFrom"]=1094,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="68a2b5aa4ea5c04a487f377410fa8064b114349cb80557ef880dd297d407c850",["opening"]="Riddlevox had ordered Gerenzo's removal after controversy in Undermine. Sputtervalve suspected trade-prince involvement but identified that connection as a hunch.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the new orders to Ziz.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Sputtervalve's orders to Ziz.",["sourceHash"]="68a2b5aa4ea5c04a487f377410fa8064b114349cb80557ef880dd297d407c850",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1096]={["aftermath"]="Ziz hoped this proof would win him a workshop assignment; the transfer remained his expectation.",["atomIDs"]={"1096:description:1-67","1096:description:69-204","1096:description:209-322","1096:description:324-402","1096:description:404-450","1096:description:455-508","1096:objective:1-88"},["bridge"]="The order pointed back to Gerenzo above Cragpool Lake. Fizziks described the machinery grafted onto his body and sought the mechanical arm as proof of an attack he could not carry out himself.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"1096:description:1-67","1096:description:69-204","1096:description:209-322","1096:description:324-402","1096:description:404-450","1096:description:455-508","1096:objective:1-88"},["bridgeFrom"]=1095,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="4be8fb62cfddf6ad28cf584821e84354f65ec086d345d9b5a8be84e440ebbaeb",["endingAtomIDs"]={"1096:completion:1-21","1096:completion:23-76","1096:completion:78-199","1096:completion:204-224","1096:completion:229-265","1096:completion:267-409"},["opening"]="Ziz described Gerenzo's altered body and the water-wheel perch above Cragpool Lake. He could not reach the engineer himself and asked for the mechanical arm as proof.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover Gerenzo's mechanical arm.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the arm to Ziz.",["sourceHash"]="4be8fb62cfddf6ad28cf584821e84354f65ec086d345d9b5a8be84e440ebbaeb",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1097]={["atomIDs"]={"1097:description:1-109","1097:description:112-174","1097:description:179-208","1097:description:211-274","1097:description:277-359","1097:description:364-481","1097:objective:1-26"},["opening"]="Argus had heard of a delivery Grimand needed carried toward his dwarven homeland. Helping the Stormwind smith could also maintain the ties between human and dwarf communities.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Grimand Elmore about the delivery.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Grimand Elmore.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8b6ccdcfedb363b0e87cf4d027f9b76b7a4331e3d3c1e04ef61d6fd4215a675a",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1098]={["aftermath"]="Vincent lay dead, keeping any unshared intelligence beyond recovery. Adamant would send his own report to Hadrec; a trinket remained clutched in Vincent's hand.",["atomIDs"]={"1098:description:1-108","1098:description:111-242","1098:description:247-271","1098:description:274-355","1098:description:358-405","1098:description:410-460","1098:description:463-474","1098:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1098:completion:1-38","1098:completion:43-105","1098:completion:107-170","1098:completion:175-220"},["opening"]="Two deathstalkers sent to prepare an assault on Shadowfang had not returned. Hadrec needed their intelligence and any aid they required before the larger attack could be judged possible.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Deathstalkers Adamant and Vincent.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the search for the named deathstalkers.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="311353a24daa35caf0d471c83674e04c4c6fc994ca789dac1f4afc100b06afbd",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1100]={["atomIDs"]={"1100:description:1-60","1100:objective:1-31"},["opening"]="Henrig's weathered journal offered an account to read before bringing it to Falfindel. The written pages were the evidence this encounter provided.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to read the journal and bring it to Falfindel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented Henrig's journal to Falfindel.",["sourceHash"]="c2e46256b6eb55bd50ed8cdda5ba1990abf3e6a8cf47aa788f81f89b72705aa4",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1101]={["aftermath"]="Falfindel expected local studies to resume, but the corruption of Agamaggan's resting place remained unexplained.",["atomIDs"]={"1101:description:1-14","1101:description:16-32","1101:description:34-42","1101:description:44-68","1101:description:73-117","1101:description:119-131","1101:description:133-154","1101:description:156-171","1101:description:176-223","1101:description:225-267","1101:description:269-307","1101:description:312-362","1101:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1101:completion:1-32","1101:completion:34-60","1101:completion:65-138","1101:completion:143-220","1101:completion:222-330","1101:completion:335-406"},["opening"]="Falfindel saw the journal as a reason to confront Charlga without delay. A medallion from the Kraul would provide proof of the crone's defeat.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover Razorflank's medallion.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the medallion to Falfindel.",["sourceHash"]="92c5cd2bd1f4446aeb91ed81ccea21e9983aea87ab9097584a1861f2dc33bdf3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1102]={["atomIDs"]={"1102:description:1-70","1102:description:75-157","1102:description:159-211","1102:description:213-236","1102:description:238-277","1102:description:282-386","1102:description:391-445","1102:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Auld remembered sacred southern Barrens lands lost to many enemies. His grievance focused on Charlga and the army gathering within Razorfen Kraul.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Razorflank's heart to Auld.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the heart in Thunder Bluff.",["sourceHash"]="d95d95b30772d3fd880f394b0a51b4f68bf96a89a7f9e07242f05a67f46c6b80",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1103]={["atomIDs"]={"1103:description:1-28","1103:description:30-111","1103:description:116-248","1103:description:253-263","1103:description:265-269","1103:description:271-325","1103:description:327-410","1103:description:415-510","1103:objective:1-116"},["opening"]="Tiev offered another chance to reach the pure water spirit if the earlier meeting had been missed. A Water Sapta from Islen would establish readiness while he delayed his own brazier offering.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring a Water Sapta to Tiev.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered a Water Sapta to Tiev Mordune.",["sourceClassMask"]="64",["sourceHash"]="e6f96543e89782d78c5138ef9810fdaf2f64ab80c724fa5ffbd86fa223c5afe0",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
