[1105]={["atomIDs"]={"1105:description:1-55","1105:description:58-86","1105:description:89-108","1105:description:110-202","1105:description:207-261","1105:description:266-318","1105:description:321-378","1105:description:381-422","1105:description:427-454","1105:description:457-485","1105:objective:1-78"},["opening"]="Wizzle feared his brother's new fuel would eat through the rocket car. Tortoise shells could reinforce tanks strong enough to contain it.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather nine hardened tortoise shells.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Wizzle with the shells.",["sourceHash"]="d2a98dfedce7d66fd96bcf2f15c484104ec4b5c5765a2fdabf8fec7c45ac88d1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1106]={["atomIDs"]={"1106:description:1-60","1106:description:63-92","1106:description:95-161","1106:description:164-230","1106:description:235-274","1106:description:279-308","1106:description:311-369","1106:description:372-412","1106:description:417-495","1106:description:500-508","1106:objective:1-59"},["opening"]="Fizzle's engine designs had outgrown his pistons. He hoped Martek's knowledge of metal could produce parts able to endure the new stresses.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry Fizzle's letter to the Badlands.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the letter to Martek.",["sourceHash"]="a5b65dca00a26fc61196f964aee3dad082e17718f24ab477c5a9ee8c9e899205",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1107]={["atomIDs"]={"1107:description:1-49","1107:description:52-67","1107:description:69-114","1107:description:119-194","1107:description:197-325","1107:description:330-365","1107:description:368-408","1107:description:411-501","1107:objective:1-74"},["opening"]="Speed threatened the car through friction as well as force. Wizzle sought murloc fins for a hard, salt-resistant coating on its moving parts.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to collect ten fins from the Vile Reef.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the encrusted fins to Wizzle.",["sourceHash"]="e5d65f2b0ee424e186efb9532d853aab51e833cfd99927091630d4d521c00a09",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1108]={["atomIDs"]={"1108:description:1-47","1108:description:50-128","1108:description:133-247","1108:description:250-280","1108:description:285-304","1108:description:307-362","1108:description:367-484","1108:description:487-508","1108:objective:1-62"},["opening"]="Martek had heard that indurium resisted heat and stress. Flakes carried by Stonevault troggs would let him test the rumor before recommending the metal.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring ten indurium flakes to Martek.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the flakes for Martek's tests.",["sourceHash"]="a84faacdb7c514dcd9c21abfd4879390d6561e2bb2e2d845d56c12f8934fa269",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1109]={["atomIDs"]={"1109:description:1-45","1109:description:47-102","1109:description:107-196","1109:description:198-229","1109:description:234-265","1109:description:267-289","1109:description:294-325","1109:description:327-435","1109:description:437-505","1109:objective:1-75"},["opening"]="Faranell needed an uncommon material for the Society's more ambitious experiments. Kraul bats supplied the guano that would let his work begin.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to collect a pile of Kraul guano.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the guano to Faranell.",["sourceHash"]="4dd062039ad275969d0873d4a869afe0863d3211f832ccf3c928e94ec3374d99",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1110]={["atomIDs"]={"1110:description:1-107","1110:description:110-244","1110:description:249-306","1110:description:309-377","1110:description:382-408","1110:description:411-448","1110:objective:1-70"},["opening"]="Crash debris littered the flats after the races. Kravel saw the discarded parts as stock that could be sold back to the racing crews.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather thirty discarded car parts.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the recovered parts to Kravel.",["sourceHash"]="a797d1a087b422932713f10f2a05fd8201016b03a080bc20259a15a1f964cdac",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1111]={["atomIDs"]={"1111:description:1-99","1111:description:102-190","1111:description:195-229","1111:description:232-329","1111:description:334-381","1111:description:386-434","1111:objective:1-62"},["opening"]="The gnomes' parts reached Ratchet a week ago, but Kravel had not collected them. His order had to reach Dizzywig before the cargo could travel onward.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to present Kravel's order at the docks.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the parts order to Dizzywig.",["sourceHash"]="2c53bb5e81cbf88b2f21db33ec6c931baf3bcdb3da3281adaa21d73fbf6c5c54",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1112]={["aftermath"]="Kravel proposed removing one small item before forwarding the shipment.",["atomIDs"]={"1112:description:1-28","1112:description:31-66","1112:description:68-131","1112:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1112:completion:1-20","1112:completion:22-59","1112:completion:61-72","1112:completion:77-108"},["opening"]="Dizzywig released the waiting package with a message about Kravel's unpaid tab. The parts were ready for the journey back to the flats.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry the package to Kravel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Kravel's parts.",["sourceHash"]="00eb254da14c2d1840f4ff890061025916a019e0aff29388c2704306f06e5291",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1113]={["atomIDs"]={"1113:description:1-50","1113:description:52-253","1113:description:255-270","1113:description:275-346","1113:description:348-443","1113:description:445-510","1113:objective:1-68"},["opening"]="Faranell's experiment set opposed substances against an ever-toxic agent. Hearts from Scarlet zealots, inside or outside their Monastery, were the twenty samples required for the anticipated ghastly reaction.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather twenty Hearts of Zeal for Faranell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twenty Hearts of Zeal to Master Apothecary Faranell.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="638ac437f2d3f982d789f3fbda9a755695bb200411b5f0049758d45aecb4cfe6",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1114]={["aftermath"]="Fizzle recognized the hydro ratchets and repeater bolts as the components he needed.",["atomIDs"]={"1114:description:1-67","1114:description:70-178","1114:description:183-225","1114:description:228-254","1114:description:259-267","1114:objective:1-70"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1114:completion:1-15","1114:completion:17-53","1114:completion:55-78","1114:completion:80-89"},["opening"]="Kravel had taken a piece from the order and asked that it go unmentioned. Fizzle still awaited the remaining delicate car parts.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the parts to Fizzle.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the delicate parts to Fizzle.",["sourceHash"]="9657996d28e81744c930fbd199b95882cb24318ae6679848bf0d1b0e11183a80",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1115]={["atomIDs"]={"1115:description:1-82","1115:description:89-168","1115:description:171-197","1115:description:200-232","1115:description:234-267","1115:description:272-366","1115:description:369-421","1115:description:426-510","1115:objective:1-28"},["opening"]="Kravel suspected the goblin pilot raced under an assumed name. He hoped Krazek could uncover a secret worth turning into profit.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to ask Krazek about Nazz's past.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Krazek in Booty Bay.",["sourceHash"]="5319f781a4a8d66a1cd37e9bc9fac0431334e73e974e118025e699c4dc422a73",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1116]={["atomIDs"]={"1116:description:1-53","1116:description:56-74","1116:description:77-142","1116:description:144-179","1116:description:184-253","1116:description:264-279","1116:description:282-350","1116:description:353-401","1116:description:406-467","1116:objective:1-53","1116:objective:56-125"},["opening"]="Krazek's information about Nazz came with a condition. While he contacted his sources, he wanted dream dust from the swamp's dragon whelps for his snuff.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather ten specks for Krazek.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the dream dust to Booty Bay.",["sourceHash"]="3bc13318a128ea32cf39512cf952abffa8dd462bb4bcfc784251fb491c42fb93",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1117]={["aftermath"]="Kravel saw the secret as leverage and expected Nazz to pay to suppress it.",["atomIDs"]={"1117:description:1-110","1117:description:113-149","1117:description:154-238","1117:description:241-301","1117:description:306-345","1117:objective:1-68"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1117:completion:1-10","1117:completion:12-33","1117:completion:35-51","1117:completion:53-122","1117:completion:127-151","1117:completion:153-212","1117:completion:214-222"},["opening"]="Krazek had spent favors and wine to uncover Nazz's history. He put the dangerous information in a letter while insisting his own role stay concealed.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry Krazek's findings to Kravel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the rumors to Kravel.",["sourceHash"]="ba20c5b0adf7e20adca6b94216ebf52a4fef04efb05805c328d266c7fdeadd9b",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1118]={["aftermath"]="Crank identified a need for something that addled the wits and considered Zanzil's mixture.",["atomIDs"]={"1118:description:1-97","1118:description:102-135","1118:description:138-198","1118:description:201-253","1118:description:258-297","1118:description:300-320","1118:description:323-357","1118:description:360-401","1118:description:406-426","1118:description:429-477","1118:description:480-507","1118:objective:1-54"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1118:completion:1-6","1118:completion:8-39","1118:completion:41-88","1118:completion:93-135","1118:completion:137-157","1118:completion:162-226"},["opening"]="Kravel's next scheme sent the route back to Booty Bay. Crank was to receive the letter and provide whatever help the plan required.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take Kravel's scheme to Crank.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the letter to Crank.",["sourceHash"]="977d0d8894fdc56df328808db723e4342441da1864587b2415d19dee2e85687d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1119]={["atomIDs"]={"1119:description:1-81","1119:description:84-98","1119:description:101-185","1119:description:190-245","1119:description:248-331","1119:description:334-364","1119:objective:1-62"},["opening"]="Crank had combined Zanzil's mixture with stout. The resulting drink might serve Kravel's plan, but altered yeast would make it spoil before long.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the experimental stout while it is fresh.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the prepared stout to Kravel.",["sourceHash"]="b40838c11cc2d8b4e325e8483a0c1a5963dafe8a66ade7b0892e5547eb91f94a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1120]={["aftermath"]="The boss accepted it despite the approaching race and considered letting his crew drink a little.",["atomIDs"]={"1120:description:1-56","1120:description:59-157","1120:description:162-185","1120:description:188-221","1120:objective:1-45"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1120:completion:1-6","1120:completion:8-23","1120:completion:25-34","1120:completion:39-94","1120:completion:96-137","1120:completion:139-179"},["opening"]="One possible test targeted the gnome pit crew. Kravel offered the perishable stout for delivery to its boss before the next race.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to give the stout to the gnome pit boss.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the stout to the gnome crew.",["sourceHash"]="47c71c333cafad5be4189983ffdd05bc46e1a9634db91e49e51ac4ffd5803711",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1121]={["aftermath"]="The boss agreed to try a little of the drink.",["atomIDs"]={"1121:description:1-56","1121:description:59-159","1121:description:164-187","1121:description:190-223","1121:objective:1-46"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1121:completion:1-21","1121:completion:23-32","1121:completion:37-82"},["opening"]="Kravel's alternative test targeted the goblin pit crew. The same perishable drink had to reach its boss before it went bad.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to give the stout to the goblin pit boss.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the stout to the goblin crew.",["sourceHash"]="c439a835bd357a7ed32c41b28b24f4465a20e99efb7d5d499e506923ed85c3e5",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1122]={["aftermath"]="Crank offered to prepare more if further quantities of Zanzil's mixture were supplied.",["atomIDs"]={"1122:description:1-31","1122:description:34-72","1122:description:74-133","1122:description:138-227","1122:description:230-271","1122:description:276-343","1122:objective:1-62"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1122:completion:1-49","1122:completion:51-67","1122:completion:72-174"},["opening"]="Kravel called the stout's test a success and had placed a bet on the coming race. He sent Crank a report in hopes of obtaining more for later races.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the test report to Crank.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Kravel's report in Booty Bay.",["sourceHash"]="3898cf63ff6e4e7f9529a0651f665ff0eb35ce8f08f9d9eb25cc7ec7e93026db",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1123]={["aftermath"]="Rabine welcomed the shared purpose of preserving Azeroth.",["atomIDs"]={"1123:description:1-155","1123:description:158-216","1123:description:221-276","1123:description:279-379","1123:description:382-491","1123:description:494-503","1123:objective:1-66","1123:objective:69-165"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1123:completion:1-116","1123:completion:121-191","1123:completion:193-339","1123:completion:341-399","1123:completion:404-434"},["opening"]="Hamuul named Rabine as the organizer seeking help beyond Un'Goro. He warned of tension between Darnassus and Moonglade and urged dealings that looked past racial divisions.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to meet Rabine in Nighthaven.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Remulos's majordomo.",["sourceHash"]="b2eecf13ec8af171ca777d376596c3ac42600f9ec55bf90731a09fac0a89759d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1124]={["atomIDs"]={"1124:description:1-84","1124:description:87-181","1124:description:184-255","1124:description:257-275","1124:description:280-418","1124:description:421-485","1124:objective:1-100"},["opening"]="Rabine remembered Silithus as the site of an ancient war whose enemy was sealed away. He suspected forces were stirring that horror and sent a letter of introduction to Layo Starstrike at Valor's Rest.",["pending"]="{actor} would show Rabine's Letter to Layo Starstrike in Silithus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Rabine's Letter to Layo Starstrike near Valor's Rest.",["sourceHash"]="090ed09ffffd1d6a1518c23bfbdb3543a904d5e4ffbacefd9b62a4974255805e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1125]={["aftermath"]="Layo regarded the hive's response as evidence of its role in the village's destruction and saw it as a threat to further work.",["atomIDs"]={"1125:description:1-69","1125:description:72-111","1125:description:116-206","1125:description:209-277","1125:description:280-346","1125:description:351-429","1125:description:432-505","1125:objective:1-162"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1125:completion:1-110","1125:completion:112-246","1125:completion:251-351","1125:completion:353-428"},["opening"]="Southwind's ruined night-elven base held wandering defenders' spirits after the silithid invasion. Layo chose their release as the first work at the tragic site.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to free eight druids and eight sentinels.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the spirit assignment.",["sourceHash"]="73112336ef3cf93b9869ee32bc4d75903db48624e597e77b5f7c4f445ebe21ed",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1126]={["aftermath"]="An exposed portion suggested a book beneath the encrusted shell, raising hope of an ancient record.",["atomIDs"]={"1126:description:1-93","1126:description:96-256","1126:description:261-345","1126:description:348-397","1126:description:400-442","1126:description:445-500","1126:objective:1-96","1126:objective:99-217"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1126:completion:1-11","1126:completion:13-23","1126:completion:28-51","1126:completion:53-63","1126:completion:65-101","1126:completion:103-146","1126:completion:148-187","1126:completion:192-248","1126:completion:250-277","1126:completion:279-355","1126:completion:360-405"},["opening"]="Layo thought the hive's sensitivity could be used to investigate it. The tower's circling wasps marked the strongest presence and the place to stir it into activity.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to inspect the tower and recover anything unusual.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the unusual find to Layo.",["sourceHash"]="1e975ea4bc5c6c99c693795c84e4db113f507672ed955dadad3008b7f147304d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1127]={["atomIDs"]={"1127:description:1-34","1127:description:37-77","1127:description:82-164","1127:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Crank offered another batch of Fool's Stout in exchange for more of Zanzil's mixture. The return to the races still depended on twelve samples of the outcast's concoction.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring twelve Zanzil's Mixtures to Crank for the stout.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twelve Zanzil's Mixtures to Crank Fizzlebub.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2449ac7ba6ae9de0eab7b1316fc0271d6d7e3ffc76d03e4978036e13969a6bd1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1130]={["atomIDs"]={"1130:description:1-75","1130:description:80-149","1130:description:152-186","1130:objective:1-44"},["opening"]="Jorn passed on word that Melor had heard of the recent deeds. The Hunter's Rise teacher had another path to offer if the traveler wished to take it.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Melor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Melor in Thunder Bluff.",["sourceHash"]="d724ff8dca5cbb09d7b0e30779c33fe671aadf7e48665d585f077b082c4ab0dc",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1131]={["aftermath"]="Melor treated the creature's removal as a cleansing of a harmful taint.",["atomIDs"]={"1131:description:1-26","1131:description:29-55","1131:description:58-114","1131:description:119-174","1131:description:177-236","1131:description:241-309","1131:description:312-418","1131:description:423-441","1131:description:444-468","1131:objective:1-58"},["bridge"]="Melor saw Steelsnap's terror over peaceful beasts as something beyond ordinary hunting for food or honor. The hyena's rib would be proof that this taint had been confronted.",["bridgeFrom"]=1130,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"1131:completion:1-96","1131:completion:101-138"},["opening"]="Melor distinguished this hunt from food, honor and ordinary teaching. He regarded the hyena's terror over peaceful beasts as something outside the Earthmother's blessing.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Steelsnap's rib.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the rib to Melor.",["sourceHash"]="a08d23077fca21d8ed9d82737de3569244340f113977f1b0fc419c7726023be9",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1132]={["atomIDs"]={"1132:description:1-28","1132:description:31-123","1132:description:128-200","1132:description:205-285","1132:description:288-397","1132:description:400-452","1132:description:457-500","1132:objective:1-72"},["opening"]="Red Jack Flint directed travelers across the sea toward Kalimdor. His partner Fiora Longears waited on Theramore's docks to guide those arriving in search of work.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Fiora Longears at Theramore.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Fiora Longears on Theramore's docks.",["sourceHash"]="8c5978689b84f015cdd12bfe1a093db83d72c9157e351dbefbf8d0516a742073",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1133]={["atomIDs"]={"1133:description:1-84","1133:description:86-101","1133:description:104-184","1133:description:187-241","1133:description:246-286","1133:description:289-317","1133:objective:1-44"},["opening"]="Fiora pointed a newcomer toward Astranaar, where Shindrell Swiftfire might need help. The advice came without an introduction: Shindrell did not know the elf sending the traveler.",["pending"]="{actor} would offer assistance to Shindrell Swiftfire in Astranaar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Shindrell Swiftfire in Astranaar.",["sourceHash"]="b126961cc764a2dd0e875436b0b669741c24bce88086dea4e3e20f360124f2da",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1134]={["atomIDs"]={"1134:description:1-64","1134:description:67-136","1134:description:141-330","1134:description:333-414","1134:description:419-462","1134:description:465-504","1134:objective:1-66"},["opening"]="Shindrell had heard a troubling report from Theramore: orcs might be harvesting Stonetalon pridewing venom for covert killings. She wanted the venom source denied if the report was true, asking for twelve sacs from near Mirkfallon Lake.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover twelve Pridewing Venom Sacs for Shindrell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twelve Pridewing Venom Sacs to Shindrell Swiftfire.",["sourceHash"]="ede24a53517414e34038eca6b5639ade4712b830661c7549434c401880b91472",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1135]={["atomIDs"]={"1135:description:1-67","1135:description:70-179","1135:description:182-243","1135:description:245-265","1135:description:270-351","1135:description:354-395","1135:description:398-418","1135:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Fiora valued wyvern venom beyond its source's usefulness as a mount. She sought full sacs from the Highperch creatures in Thousand Needles.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather ten Highperch venom sacs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the sacs to Fiora.",["sourceHash"]="219e5703c331e016dd419b9b825482e51a7377e7f476e15cc954b6cee455fe87",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1136]={["aftermath"]="Melor acknowledged both qualities and joined the mountain hunt to the earlier valley journey.",["atomIDs"]={"1136:description:1-54","1136:description:57-70","1136:description:75-129","1136:description:132-206","1136:description:209-232","1136:description:237-292","1136:description:295-317","1136:description:320-366","1136:description:371-381","1136:description:384-436","1136:description:439-508","1136:objective:1-58"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1136:completion:1-70","1136:completion:72-85","1136:completion:90-185","1136:completion:187-282"},["opening"]="The elusive yeti's white coat hid him in Alterac's snow. Melor supplied written instructions for luring him, making cunning as necessary as the long journey.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover Frostmaw's mane.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the mane.",["sourceHash"]="5738e3767ee316402a726abd8fccaa1bd366bcb69db85d3862911402b56f386f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1137]={["atomIDs"]={"1137:description:1-43","1137:description:46-88","1137:description:91-144","1137:description:149-247","1137:description:250-285","1137:description:290-353","1137:description:358-374","1137:description:377-501","1137:objective:1-53"},["opening"]="Martek's tests showed remarkable heat resistance in the indurium flakes. The pistons would require true ore from Uldaman, and Fizzle had to hear the finding.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to relay Martek's findings to Fizzle.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Fizzle with Martek's news.",["sourceHash"]="f602f9d0d5c56ea9d7730262fe39a492d79db555d87995e590151ecc9c07a9e1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1138]={["atomIDs"]={"1138:description:1-12","1138:description:15-45","1138:description:48-99","1138:description:102-147","1138:description:150-263","1138:description:266-274","1138:description:276-291","1138:description:296-359","1138:description:362-428","1138:description:431-457","1138:description:460-499","1138:objective:1-57"},["opening"]="Gubber's enthusiasm for crab ranged through soups, stews and countless other dishes. Fishing kept him occupied, so he sought six fine chunks from reef crawlers and encrusted tide crawlers.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather six Fine Crab Chunks for Gubber.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered six Fine Crab Chunks to Gubber Blump.",["sourceHash"]="4ca0c63b9fcbbce71b9f4085691cd860b0c5f662ebf15dda52cd73da9ef03ecc",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1139]={["aftermath"]="Belgrum planned to send the shard to the king's mages so they could test the legends.",["atomIDs"]={"1139:description:1-119","1139:description:121-150","1139:description:152-353","1139:description:358-427","1139:description:432-495","1139:objective:1-73"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1139:completion:1-79","1139:completion:84-103","1139:completion:105-170","1139:completion:172-234","1139:completion:236-352"},["opening"]="Hammertoe's greater aim survived the ambassador's defeat. Belgrum sought a titan-inscribed tablet whose reputed power over created life remained a matter of legend.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the tablet before the Shadowforge.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Tablet of Will to Belgrum.",["sourceHash"]="ff64302cb001d608c643e32166b2e458df57c52b155a1138e8953bc2f1ebf575",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1140]={["aftermath"]="Delgren judged Athrikus weakened by the destruction of the soulgems. He wanted that opening used against the cult before its strength returned.",["atomIDs"]={"1140:description:1-73","1140:description:75-210","1140:description:215-388","1140:description:393-509","1140:objective:1-115"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1140:completion:1-75","1140:completion:77-142","1140:completion:147-231","1140:completion:233-296"},["opening"]="Ilkrud's writing pointed Delgren toward two remaining soulgems in Night Run and Satyrnaar. The trapped Highborne souls lay in satyr-held temples of northeastern Ashenvale, where their release had to be sought.",["pending"]="{actor} would free the trapped Highborne souls and return to Delgren.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the soul-release assignment in Night Run and Satyrnaar and returned to Delgren.",["sourceHash"]="7216b52ce07916d9325ef384b3c5d645f40417f6b5f1503a3fb706ee47a75272",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1141]={["atomIDs"]={"1141:description:1-15","1141:description:18-55","1141:description:58-89","1141:description:94-176","1141:description:179-296","1141:description:299-344","1141:description:349-395","1141:description:398-459","1141:description:462-502","1141:objective:1-56"},["opening"]="Gubber wanted Darkshore grouper, but murlocs had stopped the boats from going out. He offered a family fishing pole to someone who could bring him six of the fish.",["pending"]="{actor} would catch six Darkshore Grouper for Gubber.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered six Darkshore Grouper to Gubber Blump.",["sourceHash"]="a48265904e00e77306a73ac48bf367d9a248affb7b1014dbb2aa1774216da3f5",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1142]={["aftermath"]="Treshala received the news with grief and resolved that Heralath's work had to continue.",["atomIDs"]={"1142:description:1-26","1142:description:40-44","1142:description:49-120","1142:description:125-139","1142:description:141-150","1142:description:155-177","1142:description:179-209","1142:description:211-219","1142:description:221-256","1142:description:261-281","1142:description:283-323","1142:description:328-365","1142:description:367-372","1142:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1142:completion:8-21","1142:completion:23-54","1142:completion:59-137","1142:completion:142-199","1142:completion:201-224","1142:completion:229-254"},["opening"]="Heralath's wounds left little time. He asked that his stolen bonding pendant and word of his approaching death reach Treshala in Darnassus.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Treshala's pendant and carry the news.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the pendant to Treshala.",["sourceHash"]="6a873ff2803c25b73e470073cef28578cf79459e70a78a4376b1a4c37f9e53e0",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1143]={["aftermath"]="Balthule hoped Athrikus's death would push back the demonic presence. He still expected the enemy to regroup, leaving vigilance beyond the immediate victory.",["atomIDs"]={"1143:description:1-6","1143:description:8-69","1143:description:71-121","1143:description:123-233","1143:objective:1-95"},["bridge"]="The consultation had reached Balthule at Althalaxx. He believed Athrikus waited at the tower's summit among powerful warlocks, and called for the direct strike and proof of its completion.",["bridgeFrom"]=1167,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"1143:completion:1-92","1143:completion:94-205"},["opening"]="Balthule believed Athrikus waited at the top of Althalaxx, surrounded by warlocks more dangerous than those below. The time for the direct strike had come, with the cult leader's head required as proof.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront Athrikus Narassin and bring his head to Balthule.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment against Athrikus Narassin and delivered his head to Balthule.",["sourceHash"]="056711eecca04e5161ccc6acabcfb30565b60b77e6bfaa6cb54c647c2c27be65",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1144]={["atomIDs"]={"1144:description:1-26","1144:description:31-85","1144:description:87-149","1144:description:154-183","1144:description:185-221","1144:description:223-314","1144:description:316-373","1144:description:375-408","1144:description:413-501","1144:objective:1-49"},["opening"]="Willix entered the Kraul hoping to profit from Mebok's demand for tubers. Captivity proved the venture far harder to leave than to enter.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to escort Willix out of the Kraul.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Willix out of Razorfen Kraul.",["sourceHash"]="d717bbfdc99e72acb94806e823468dbc51c4502d99859af219736a3272ac6822",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1145]={["atomIDs"]={"1145:description:1-158","1145:description:160-253","1145:description:258-322","1145:description:324-403","1145:description:408-466","1145:objective:1-62"},["opening"]="Reports from egg gatherers had changed Korran's assessment of the insects. He now considered them a greater threat and sent a sealed note to Belgrom.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver Korran's warning in Orgrimmar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the sealed note to Belgrom.",["sourceHash"]="8127e70068280313557e695fcf42fbef2377dd509c43ae797f9d216afd2027ae",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1146]={["aftermath"]="Moktar described losing more than half the party and remaining in position until Belgrom's orders arrived.",["atomIDs"]={"1146:description:1-113","1146:description:118-190","1146:description:192-287","1146:description:289-393","1146:description:398-490","1146:description:492-511","1146:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1146:completion:1-58","1146:completion:60-173","1146:completion:175-273","1146:completion:278-341","1146:completion:343-399"},["opening"]="Korran's warning matched a survivor's report from the Flats. Insects erupting during an attack on a dwarven dig nearly destroyed Moktar's party, giving Belgrom reason to send orders to the survivors.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver Belgrom's sealed note.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Moktar with the dispatch.",["sourceHash"]="228d6482690ac2cdfde5e087791313ddc143d4f1641ad255437002052e943bdf",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1147]={["atomIDs"]={"1147:description:1-4","1147:description:6-54","1147:description:56-125","1147:description:130-263","1147:description:265-335","1147:description:337-372","1147:description:374-421","1147:description:423-489","1147:objective:1-121"},["opening"]="Moktar's war band was too badly hurt to confront the insects alone. Belgrom's orders directed another battle at the dig south of their position.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront the three silithid groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Moktar's assignment against the silithid.",["sourceHash"]="c189e523180970499a7944c79bebf885e08d523cd320d732d7defe0063ad1b28",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1148]={["aftermath"]="Korran regarded them as a start for research alongside the eggs, rather than a resolution of the mystery.",["atomIDs"]={"1148:description:1-35","1148:description:37-169","1148:description:171-208","1148:description:210-322","1148:description:327-429","1148:description:431-510","1148:objective:1-104"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1148:completion:1-33","1148:completion:35-66","1148:completion:68-244","1148:completion:249-293","1148:completion:295-451"},["opening"]="The creature's interwoven carapace suggested unusual strength. Further specimens might help Korran determine what the insects were and where they came from.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Korran a heart, talons and carapaces.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the silithid specimens to Korran.",["sourceHash"]="7c5b73916d70f1e46efcdbc007f251b3634a722034b9389df11be877caf4f531",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1149]={["atomIDs"]={"1149:description:1-64","1149:description:66-75","1149:description:77-130","1149:description:135-194","1149:description:196-251","1149:description:253-299","1149:description:301-357","1149:description:362-405","1149:description:407-468","1149:description:473-501","1149:objective:1-69"},["opening"]="Dorn offered tests of spirit, body and mind. His first asked for a leap from the planks overlooking Thousand Needles, with faith preceding any guarantee.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to undertake Dorn's leap of faith.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the leap and returned to Dorn.",["sourceHash"]="818cb97212ae76deb2858b9c6fd8d6ff21ed9306c951cd493cabd70c6d4f1fb2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1150]={["atomIDs"]={"1150:description:1-87","1150:description:89-152","1150:description:157-185","1150:description:187-235","1150:description:237-307","1150:description:309-497","1150:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Dorn turned from faith to endurance in the Roguefeather Den. Destroying its food was intended to draw Grenka into the confrontation.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover Grenka's claw for Dorn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Grenka's claw after completing the endurance trial.",["sourceHash"]="2fd451b3722c95e1dfca3699f598763a1d2d4f6dd303d19cb4584903cc2c9de6",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1151]={["atomIDs"]={"1151:description:1-73","1151:description:75-179","1151:description:181-302","1151:description:307-334","1151:description:336-400","1151:description:402-432","1151:description:437-506","1151:objective:1-69"},["opening"]="Dorn described Rok'Alim as an elemental able to remain without a summoner. The next trial set bodily strength against that enduring presence.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring fragments of Rok'Alim to Dorn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the fragments after the strength trial.",["sourceHash"]="69d5ba9c6aa6fae94b7161757e4b76799a63f748aa055d63b49d6ee73a61c8d8",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1152]={["atomIDs"]={"1152:description:1-41","1152:description:43-103","1152:description:105-186","1152:description:191-273","1152:description:275-322","1152:description:327-441","1152:description:443-507","1152:objective:1-81"},["opening"]="Dorn's instruction ended before the test of knowledge. Braug near Talondeep Path had to judge that part of the journey.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to seek Braug for the next trial.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Braug near Talondeep Path.",["sourceHash"]="4fcde35adfea24f35e9a03bc99686742ff82f12ce8100dbd47e4f2380eccb658",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1153]={["aftermath"]="Tatternack planned to test it and send a weapon to the Warchief only if the material proved strong enough.",["atomIDs"]={"1153:description:1-49","1153:description:51-163","1153:description:165-302","1153:description:307-382","1153:description:384-468","1153:description:470-508","1153:objective:1-134"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1153:completion:1-18","1153:completion:20-40","1153:completion:45-141","1153:completion:146-183","1153:completion:185-304","1153:completion:309-341"},["opening"]="Travelers refused to sell Tatternack an unusual ore found on a kobold. He sought another sample from Thousand Needles to examine its value for weapons.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover an unrefined ore sample.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the sample to Tatternack.",["sourceHash"]="62f35f8cd2f4aaf37d835c87b8416a942945f9295e89812199bff1639900f428",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1154]={["aftermath"]="Braug still required an answer about its contents; bringing the volume alone did not finish his examination.",["atomIDs"]={"1154:description:1-71","1154:description:73-82","1154:description:84-136","1154:description:138-206","1154:description:211-311","1154:description:316-345","1154:description:347-372","1154:description:374-486","1154:objective:1-124"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1154:completion:1-25","1154:completion:27-85","1154:completion:87-132","1154:completion:137-211"},["opening"]="Braug set a study task rather than another contest of strength. The required book lay in Dor'danil among dead druids and their killers.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover and study the named book.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Legacy of the Aspects to Braug.",["sourceHash"]="4c5993a64378efe38d601ead507a0a61690f66348c137328ba1717497b4c847a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1159]={["atomIDs"]={"1159:description:1-14","1159:description:16-121","1159:description:123-159","1159:description:164-208","1159:description:210-280","1159:description:282-347","1159:description:352-500","1159:objective:1-36"},["opening"]="Braug sent the remaining question to Parqual, a historian whose pursuit of knowledge survived the plague. Another requirement awaited before that examination.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find Parqual in the Undercity.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Parqual for the next lore trial.",["sourceHash"]="e1d32e8d290b5e9b157f6fe9ed2f9538b96924c9c930db87a9bfec370685e4b3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1160]={["atomIDs"]={"1160:description:1-116","1160:description:118-163","1160:description:165-261","1160:description:266-317","1160:description:319-394","1160:description:396-472","1160:description:477-491","1160:objective:1-90"},["opening"]="Parqual valued knowledge above passing displays of strength. A training book once used against the undead survived in the Monastery library, and its recovery formed the next test he chose.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover The Beginnings of the Undead Threat.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered The Beginnings of the Undead Threat to Parqual Fintallas.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="4d3e826a4ae35424dc16af109affa3cf1330622ad201a428a10beb11992d8483",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1164]={["aftermath"]="Genavie expressed gratitude and said her attention could turn to other pursuits.",["atomIDs"]={"1164:description:1-11","1164:description:13-22","1164:description:24-92","1164:description:94-109","1164:description:114-152","1164:description:154-211","1164:description:213-325","1164:description:330-379","1164:description:381-412","1164:description:417-433","1164:description:435-499","1164:objective:1-80"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1164:completion:1-82","1164:completion:87-235","1164:completion:237-298"},["opening"]="Genavie had lost family and estate to plague and war. She accused the Dabyries of stealing what remained and now demanded vengeance on them rather than recovery of the possessions.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the three Dabyries' heads to Genavie.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the revenge assignment.",["sourceHash"]="820a809548ca9d9866cdf5afb0f956735b5afb6d57b56afc41a2e7856a25c427",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1166]={["atomIDs"]={"1166:description:1-31","1166:description:36-82","1166:description:87-101","1166:description:103-120","1166:description:125-167","1166:description:169-182","1166:description:184-211","1166:description:216-255","1166:description:257-282","1166:description:284-342","1166:description:344-373","1166:description:375-421","1166:description:423-445","1166:objective:1-115"},["opening"]="Mok'Morokk led the clan away when dragons burned its old home. The hurried flight left his grog, snuff and strongbox behind in the ruins.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover Mok'Morokk's three possessions.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the grog, snuff and strongbox.",["sourceHash"]="8e7ac30e3c9f17c1cc1d1e569fd4f1d5b3850d7fa55353ee90715c547fc85365",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1167]={["atomIDs"]={"1167:description:1-88","1167:description:90-207","1167:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Delgren advised consulting Balthule before confronting Athrikus. The watcher near Althalaxx might know recent developments that distant study had missed.",["pending"]="{actor} would consult Balthule Shadowstrike near Althalaxx.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Balthule Shadowstrike near the tower.",["sourceHash"]="55fb2a2f42f67d11e22cba874c0fd3aaf6b3f194f292af60581005244f39170a",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1168]={["atomIDs"]={"1168:description:1-39","1168:description:41-86","1168:description:91-119","1168:description:121-138","1168:description:140-165","1168:description:167-184","1168:description:189-206","1168:description:208-233","1168:description:235-272","1168:description:277-305","1168:description:307-330","1168:description:332-351","1168:description:356-397","1168:description:399-414","1168:description:416-434","1168:objective:1-116"},["opening"]="Tharg lost his wife to the dragons and resented the retreat from Stonemaul. He sought revenge against their army and a path back home.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront the Firemane forces for Tharg.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Tharg's assignment against the dragon army.",["sourceHash"]="63fc9939978aa2dea925054e3b4be6209ffc0395fb2130d0097fd43c61c1914a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1169]={["atomIDs"]={"1169:description:1-239","1169:description:244-269","1169:description:271-344","1169:description:349-436","1169:description:438-475","1169:objective:1-102"},["opening"]="Draz'Zilb put the cause of the invasion ahead of the clan's leadership quarrels. Whelp and hatchling remains might let him trace the black dragons' origin.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to collect fifteen tongues and fifteen hearts.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Draz'Zilb with the brood specimens.",["sourceHash"]="9e5ff152612b9421cfac80d3303636c4e1199249e90d9f35823b8c80f9d1a40a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1170]={["aftermath"]="Mok'Morokk rejected concern about the dragons and preferred the safety of the current settlement.",["atomIDs"]={"1170:description:1-53","1170:description:55-140","1170:description:145-167","1170:description:169-258","1170:description:263-288","1170:description:290-310","1170:objective:1-54"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1170:completion:1-30","1170:completion:32-50","1170:completion:52-67","1170:completion:69-84"},["opening"]="Draz'Zilb identified Onyxia's brood as the invaders of Stonemaul. Their presence suggested a purpose beyond attacking the ogres, and Mok'Morokk had to be told.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to warn Mok'Morokk about the brood.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Draz'Zilb's warning.",["sourceHash"]="ad4cddef0f422c3e10abab5eb89783e99acb3332d84c232a71f89e8818521a23",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1171]={["aftermath"]="Draz remembered the strength Mok'Morokk had shown under Rexxar and blamed the temptations of power for changing a leader into a master demanding service.",["atomIDs"]={"1171:description:1-23","1171:description:25-55","1171:description:57-77","1171:objective:1-44"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"1171:completion:1-17","1171:completion:22-78","1171:completion:80-158","1171:completion:160-189","1171:completion:191-254","1171:completion:259-281"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Carry Mok'Morokk's refusal back to Draz'Zilb.",["opening"]="Mok'Morokk refused to move and dismissed the warning about dragons. Reporting that answer to Draz'Zilb would leave the village to confront its leader's unwillingness to act.",["pending"]="{actor} would take Mok'Morokk's answer to Draz'Zilb.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the refusal to Draz'Zilb.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="fa6abcd456b112b68ec09f95fa368232f2bf5213ab46db2680a07d8f072ff113",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[1172]={["aftermath"]="Draz'Zilb now called for Mok'Morokk's removal so a new leader could seek the clan's return home.",["atomIDs"]={"1172:description:1-56","1172:description:58-116","1172:description:121-175","1172:description:177-212","1172:description:214-264","1172:description:269-358","1172:description:363-382","1172:description:384-414","1172:objective:1-71"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1172:completion:1-9","1172:completion:11-66","1172:completion:71-110","1172:completion:115-146","1172:completion:148-202","1172:completion:207-239","1172:completion:241-317","1172:completion:319-360","1172:completion:362-444"},["opening"]="Draz'Zilb saw the scattered brood as an obstacle to reclaiming Stonemaul. He directed the search for eggs south into Wyrmbog.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to destroy five eggs of the brood.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Draz'Zilb's assignment against the eggs.",["sourceHash"]="ede75b30db890fb6b85529a7ce467b18e0a0a1192b75ea087eea27b7e1d68076",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1173]={["aftermath"]="Draz'Zilb confirmed that Mok'Morokk fled, opening the way to appoint a new leader; the old home remained to be reclaimed.",["atomIDs"]={"1173:description:1-39","1173:description:44-47","1173:description:52-68","1173:description:73-112","1173:objective:1-74"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1173:completion:1-59","1173:completion:61-94","1173:completion:99-197"},["opening"]="Mok'Morokk answered a challenge with a threat to crush the challenger. The contest would determine whether he could be driven from Brackenwall.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to defeat Mok'Morokk and report to Draz'Zilb.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the challenge and reported its outcome.",["sourceHash"]="e707f85e4e2469fd38faeb7d948a735127b79bee19131edf200f55cdd56d52d7",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1175]={["atomIDs"]={"1175:description:1-121","1175:description:123-307","1175:description:312-325","1175:description:327-420","1175:objective:1-125"},["opening"]="A collision between Red Thunder and a basilisk led Zherin to take charge of the track. He sought fewer wandering reptiles before another race met them.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to reduce the three Saltstone groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Zherin's basilisk assignment.",["sourceHash"]="7966096a447a4d8d4fe6f39b47cb46fdb0f00fd72ee5adf722b9fde450c34d97",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1176]={["atomIDs"]={"1176:description:1-42","1176:description:44-216","1176:description:221-360","1176:description:362-449","1176:description:454-506","1176:objective:1-63"},["opening"]="Pozzik weighed every change to his racer, including the frame's mass. Hollow vulture bones provided the balance of strength and lightness his crew needed.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather ten hollow bones.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Pozzik with the vulture bones.",["sourceHash"]="40d54385a32a8af4dcb76a42dd7182e164b398340bc3e317c93352911cc6a688",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1177]={["aftermath"]="Satisfied with his meal, Mudcrush withdrew his threat to eat the supplier.",["atomIDs"]={"1177:description:1-13","1177:description:18-27","1177:description:32-45","1177:description:47-61","1177:description:66-93","1177:objective:1-63"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"1177:completion:1-19","1177:completion:24-41"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Mudcrush eight Mirefin heads in northern Dustwallow.",["opening"]="Mudcrush's demand was blunt: he wanted fish heads to eat and threatened the messenger if denied. Feeding the hungry ogre offered a practical reason to seek the Mirefin nearby.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather eight Mirefin heads for Mudcrush.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Mudcrush the requested heads.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="d5fcd419663ac4ed3aabb51ac475186a6931e48dc93293734a0aea5925997080",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[1178]={["atomIDs"]={"1178:description:1-51","1178:description:53-142","1178:description:147-163","1178:description:165-214","1178:description:216-265","1178:description:270-361","1178:description:363-389","1178:description:391-451","1178:description:453-509","1178:objective:1-28"},["opening"]="Gazlowe's promised prototype regulator had not arrived. With the gnome team gaining ground, Pozzik sought an explanation for an unusual delay.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to ask Gazlowe about the regulator.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Gazlowe with Pozzik's inquiry.",["sourceHash"]="c2725dc1470137fc3b2c8cf9fcba0f551b978576c5f7b1fe8ee4a992bb9cfcc0",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1179]={["atomIDs"]={"1179:description:1-39","1179:description:42-134","1179:description:137-194","1179:description:199-321","1179:description:324-368","1179:description:371-400","1179:description:405-475","1179:description:478-499","1179:description:504-511","1179:objective:1-78"},["opening"]="Longbeard's friends had built a car fast enough to leave pilots concussed. He could not leave his duties, so a crate of protective helmets needed another courier.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry the crash helmets to Wizzle.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the helmet crate to the flats.",["sourceHash"]="ecd36ba1563d92cbc6466ca037c363865b222bba57d8f3c2cc64adeea84c44c6",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1180]={["aftermath"]="Lozgil found boots and ordinary supplies in the records, but no race parts.",["atomIDs"]={"1180:description:1-33","1180:description:35-142","1180:description:144-256","1180:description:261-312","1180:description:314-374","1180:description:379-468","1180:objective:1-43"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1180:completion:1-21","1180:completion:23-55","1180:completion:60-154","1180:completion:156-217","1180:completion:219-243"},["opening"]="Gazlowe had not received the regulator promised through Revilgaz. Before pursuing the delay, he wanted Booty Bay's outgoing cargo records checked.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to ask Lozgil whether race parts were shipped.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} checked the shipment with Lozgil.",["sourceHash"]="c7490cf58aa348a3e5128d31c793bd7f9f84d566d0f745cbbd45c6963219f654",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1181]={["aftermath"]="Revilgaz said his men failed to recover the blueprints needed for the regulator.",["atomIDs"]={"1181:description:1-51","1181:description:53-135","1181:description:137-199","1181:description:204-262","1181:objective:1-39"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1181:completion:1-52","1181:completion:54-81","1181:completion:83-199"},["opening"]="Lozgil's records could not explain the missing regulator. He directed the inquiry to Revilgaz himself across the harbor.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to question Revilgaz about the regulator.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Revilgaz with the shipment inquiry.",["sourceHash"]="b546e840580e4ad46c6aea578c1cd833ba6c74c85914b3fb36b95f6921fbdfe5",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1182]={["aftermath"]="Revilgaz made a copy before releasing the originals for Pozzik.",["atomIDs"]={"1182:description:1-136","1182:description:138-232","1182:description:234-341","1182:description:346-414","1182:description:416-498","1182:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1182:completion:1-108","1182:completion:110-180"},["opening"]="Revilgaz's promised regulator depended on stolen plans from the company at Lake Nazferiti. Cozzle kept the drawings in his house, likely locked away.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the fuel regulator blueprints.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the blueprints to Revilgaz.",["sourceHash"]="f1e4877745fab552ca79d27619dd7d31c861aed134adaac0f793d67e84538e68",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1183]={["aftermath"]="Pozzik accepted the opportunity to improve the design himself and planned to build and install it.",["atomIDs"]={"1183:description:1-28","1183:description:30-120","1183:description:122-187","1183:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1183:completion:1-138","1183:completion:140-150","1183:completion:152-252"},["opening"]="Revilgaz sent the recovered designs to the racing team with assurances of support. Pozzik would receive drawings rather than a finished regulator.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the blueprints to Pozzik.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the regulator designs to the flats.",["sourceHash"]="0b17956b60652406734777c542c1a7193c8d343041019f7849e779bd4377b755",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1184]={["aftermath"]="Belgrom continued to regard the creatures as a serious threat and asked for further news when available.",["atomIDs"]={"1184:description:1-108","1184:description:110-192","1184:description:194-224","1184:objective:1-40"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1184:completion:1-37","1184:completion:39-113","1184:completion:118-163","1184:completion:165-217","1184:completion:222-247","1184:completion:249-397"},["opening"]="Korran sent an account of Moktar's work and his own continuing research. The specimens had advanced the inquiry without yet explaining the insects.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to update Belgrom in Orgrimmar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Korran's update to Belgrom.",["sourceHash"]="f0bffc69075c06df84ee49120fca4623f970333be067b6f198ef7a84fdc64e59",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1186]={["atomIDs"]={"1186:description:1-162","1186:description:164-283","1186:description:288-357","1186:objective:1-44"},["opening"]="While Pozzik integrated the regulator, he directed further help toward the team's eighteenth pilot. Razzeric brought his own modifications to the racers.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Razzeric at the flats.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Razzeric in the racing pits.",["sourceHash"]="2046951c2592770e65e36f8da7fa0533deb71f779c3b54f1b802963ad164f2e9",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1187]={["atomIDs"]={"1187:description:1-111","1187:description:113-127","1187:description:132-308","1187:description:313-462","1187:description:464-483","1187:objective:1-68"},["opening"]="Razzeric wanted more force than Pozzik's careful designs allowed. The seaforium booster he ordered was aboard a zeppelin that crashed in Dustwallow.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover Razzeric's booster from the crash.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the seaforium booster to Razzeric.",["sourceHash"]="461adf99c89cdbced3d9cb45715511999a751dfba1e61d5c926e5e9693c2442a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1188]={["aftermath"]="Shreev disputed Razzeric's diagnosis and said he had already increased the explosive payload.",["atomIDs"]={"1188:description:1-22","1188:description:24-49","1188:description:51-126","1188:description:128-154","1188:description:156-171","1188:description:176-274","1188:objective:1-51"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1188:completion:1-100","1188:completion:102-156","1188:completion:158-291"},["opening"]="Razzeric believed the booster was constrained by a safety device. He sent it to Shreev in Gadgetzan demanding greater output.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the booster to Shreev.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the booster to the Gizmorium.",["sourceHash"]="607af5473510dd2f45452082a426df6158e8bf4547c89b1731d35722f39468c0",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1189]={["aftermath"]="Razzeric welcomed the altered booster and anticipated a new course record.",["atomIDs"]={"1189:description:1-34","1189:description:36-85","1189:description:87-189","1189:description:194-233","1189:description:235-287","1189:objective:1-74"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1189:completion:1-24","1189:completion:26-108","1189:completion:113-169"},["opening"]="Shreev had made the requested alteration and warned that the slightest mistake could be fatal. The modified booster was ready for its demanding pilot.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to return the modified booster to Razzeric.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the altered booster.",["sourceHash"]="2d9685bb0930d61a186157e92fa0ed223c2191b0be677ffb5463cee58336e54f",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1190]={["aftermath"]="The notes described refining a raw material rather than a new car design.",["atomIDs"]={"1190:description:1-110","1190:description:112-248","1190:description:253-366","1190:description:371-452","1190:objective:1-92"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1190:completion:1-106"},["opening"]="Pozzik suspected a new material explained the rival cars' improved speed. Zamek's diversion offered an opening to inspect Rizzle's closely guarded work.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to use the diversion to obtain Rizzle's plans.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} recovered the plans from Rizzle's work area.",["sourceHash"]="7a4fe54bc982df875581e0cfa4dffb072ef768dddb1ba03f750b83f9969d57ab",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1192]={["aftermath"]="Pozzik intended to set the crew to work on parts for the next race.",["atomIDs"]={"1192:requestItems:1-130","1192:requestItems:135-232","1192:requestItems:237-339"},["coverageQualification"]="BASIC_RETAINED_EXCHANGE_CONTEXT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"1192:completion:1-10","1192:completion:12-90"},["minimumStage"]=3,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring raw indurium ore to Pozzik.",["opening"]="Pozzik wanted indurium for the racers' parts. The gnomes were obtaining their own supply, and ore from Uldaman could help his crew keep pace with their rivals.",["pending"]="{actor} would obtain raw indurium ore for Pozzik.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Pozzik with indurium ore.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_REVIEWED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="98e9ac817e9d3a1c9023973d552768401b32da6debe4a64dc0c909c18dab0053",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentPlayability","unlistedQuantities"}},
[1193]={["aftermath"]="The oil passed through the fitted widget and the trap snapped into position.",["atomIDs"]={"1193:requestItems:1-37","1193:requestItems:39-116","1193:requestItems:118-268","1193:requestItems:270-357","1193:requestItems:362-432","1193:requestItems:437-444"},["coverageQualification"]="BASIC_RETAINED_EXCHANGE_CONTEXT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"1193:completion:1-97","1193:completion:99-181","1193:completion:186-251"},["minimumStage"]=3,["objectiveSummary"]="Repair the broken trap with a thorium widget and frost oil.",["opening"]="A note beside the broken trap named its missing materials: a thorium widget and frost oil. Repairs offered a way to catch a passing ogre and avoid a confrontation, if one wandered near.",["pending"]="{actor} would repair the trap with a thorium widget and frost oil.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} repaired the trap with the widget and frost oil.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_REVIEWED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="7770ed102b967c7089b08a99559312b07b4e1587953204160f0b3b88a2ba055c",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentPlayability","unlistedQuantities"}},
[1194]={["aftermath"]="Pozzik saw an explanation for the rival team's speed and planned tests, but needed more ore for practical use.",["atomIDs"]={"1194:description:1-75","1194:description:77-205","1194:description:210-273","1194:description:278-368","1194:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1194:completion:1-9","1194:completion:11-24","1194:completion:26-164","1194:completion:169-226","1194:completion:228-333"},["opening"]="Rizzle's notes identified indurium from Uldaman and emphasized resistance to heat. A piece of raw ore used as a paperweight supplied tangible evidence.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the indurium sample to Pozzik.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the ore sample to Pozzik.",["sourceHash"]="0b4c00080a6d7e480dc43fd30928f80bb133b2bcba760ed0851a49bd113db0c9",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1195]={["aftermath"]="Zangen accepted it for Rau's request and asked for onward delivery.",["atomIDs"]={"1195:description:1-109","1195:description:114-214","1195:description:219-370","1195:description:372-490","1195:objective:1-66"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1195:completion:1-10","1195:completion:12-52","1195:completion:54-83","1195:completion:85-138"},["opening"]="Zangen's plan required moonwell water to approach a protected centaur relic. A dryad's phial from Ashenvale was needed before it could be filled at the riverbank well.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to obtain and fill an etched phial.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the filled phial.",["sourceHash"]="78ed8423acff3f1b4a13ca435cc91b7ca7ffc1ac6555d46733db0dac927b5550",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1196]={["aftermath"]="Rau explained the shared ancestry of dryads and centaurs as the reason moonwell water could cross the protection.",["atomIDs"]={"1196:description:1-96","1196:description:98-194","1196:description:199-253","1196:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1196:completion:1-63","1196:completion:65-245"},["opening"]="The prepared water had to reach Freewind Post. Its source was part of the method for breaching the flame surrounding the Galak's ancient relic.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the phial to Rau.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it at Freewind.",["sourceHash"]="82a1c3dab3e654906127087b88182e3b3da292ed709faaf287347e2e7efae5e5",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1197]={["aftermath"]="Rau sensed unusual energy and began study rather than claiming the relic's mysteries solved.",["atomIDs"]={"1197:description:1-106","1197:description:108-184","1197:description:189-265","1197:description:267-338","1197:description:343-473","1197:objective:1-66"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1197:completion:1-51","1197:completion:53-150","1197:completion:155-168","1197:completion:170-235"},["opening"]="The water would suppress the sacred fire only briefly. Rau directed the recovery into guarded Splithoof Hold, where speed mattered once the flame was doused.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to retrieve the cloven relic.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the hoof to Rau.",["sourceHash"]="125b9cae3c52fda7b9852f556fa0f66bc5dd2c740f3315f54491deaa96bca7f4",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
